<h3><u>Zindaan se chut ke</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Aa gaye sadaat, aa gaye sadaat<br />
karbala aa gaye sadaat..(2)<br />
Uthiye hussain aapke zawwar aaye hai<br />
zindaa&#39;n se chut ke abid e beemar aaye hai..(2)</p>

<p>1. Bhoole nahi hai shaam aur koofe ke raaste<br />
tarse hue hai maula ye matam ke waaste<br />
sab kuch luta ke aapke ghumkhwaar aaye hai<br />
zindaa&#39;n se chut ke..</p>

<p>2. Zainab ne chalte naaqe se khud ko gira diya<br />
phir kohniyo se chalke gayi bhai se kaha<br />
humlog hoke koocha o bazaar aaye hai<br />
zindaa&#39;n se chut ke..</p>

<p>3. Gardan pe aur jismpe zanjeer ke nishaa&#39;n<br />
ek ek zakhm dard ki kehta hai dastaa&#39;n<br />
zindaa&#39;n se zinda laut ke lachaar aaye hai<br />
zindaa&#39;n se chut ke..</p>

<p>4. Jee khol kar yaha tera matam karenge hum<br />
karbobala mein majlis e chehlum karenge hum<br />
aye maula shaam wale azadaar aaye hai<br />
zindaa&#39;n se chut ke..</p>

<p>5. Zindaa&#39;n mein ek teri azadaar reh gayi<br />
karbobala na aayi na zindaa&#39;n se ghar gayi<br />
dafna ke usko abid e beemar aaye hai<br />
zindaa&#39;n se chut ke..</p>

<p>6. Zindaa&#39;n mein karke aaya hai majlis ye karwaa&#39;n<br />
sab bibiya&#39;n thi matami zainab thi nawhakhwaa&#39;n<br />
mehwe buka o deeda e khoo&#39;n khwaar aaye hai<br />
zindaa&#39;n se chut ke..</p>

<p>7. Aisa safar batool ki beti ne tay kiya<br />
dete nahi the log aseero ko raasta<br />
tay karke saari manzil e dushwaar aaye hai<br />
zindaa&#39;n se chut ke..</p>

<p>8. Be dard the wo shaam aur koofe ke sab makee&#39;n<br />
tang hogayi thi aale mohammad pe ye zamee&#39;n<br />
sadaat hoke jeene se bezaar aaye hai<br />
zindaa&#39;n se chut ke..</p>

<p>9. Farhan o mazhar abidi kyu na ho nauhagar<br />
sajjad chutke qaid se baba ki qabr par<br />
lekar nishane tauqe garo baar aaye hai<br />
zindaa&#39;n se chut ke..</p>
</p>
